{"3420020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Abyss Born", "steam_appid": 3420020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your camp lies in ruins, and dark portals have begun tearing through the world — unleashing skeletal hordes, goblin raiders, and ancient undead into the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one knows where they came from. No one knows how to stop them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, you must gather resources, build your shelter, forge uneasy alliances, and descend into cursed dungeons to uncover the truth behind the portals — and find a way to destroy them before the corruption consumes everything.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏚 <strong>Build and expand your shelter</strong> – Gather resources, fortify your base, and prepare for the dangers ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >            <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/8ece0df47caa07a74cbdc998f8d90f73.poster.avif?t=1788285912\" width=862 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/8ece0df47caa07a74cbdc998f8d90f73.webm?t=1788285912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/8ece0df47caa07a74cbdc998f8d90f73.mp4?t=1788285912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔ <strong>Explore dark dungeons</strong> – Venture into caves, ruins, catacombs, and ancient tombs filled with treasures - and nightmares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >            <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/4dfc3ac0f7f4c20073ea4602c2a40b99.poster.avif?t=1788285912\" width=862 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/4dfc3ac0f7f4c20073ea4602c2a40b99.webm?t=1788285912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/4dfc3ac0f7f4c20073ea4602c2a40b99.mp4?t=1788285912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛠 <strong>Craft weapons and armor</strong> – Forge and upgrade powerful gear to take on increasingly deadly enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >            <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/deb91863568d3fd51cfbe7694bf05b1d.poster.avif?t=1788285912\" width=862 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/deb91863568d3fd51cfbe7694bf05b1d.webm?t=1788285912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/deb91863568d3fd51cfbe7694bf05b1d.mp4?t=1788285912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>            </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌿 <strong>Alchemy and gathering</strong> – Collect herbs and mushrooms to brew powerful potions, elixirs, and deadly poisons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >            <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/a63324bdba9563a9eece13b8f1edda97.poster.avif?t=1788285912\" width=862 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/a63324bdba9563a9eece13b8f1edda97.webm?t=1788285912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/a63324bdba9563a9eece13b8f1edda97.mp4?t=1788285912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏰 <strong>Allies and trade</strong> – Earn the trust of dwarves and the human kingdom to gain access to valuable resources and support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/3b6b4e62fd2dcb2652703d4b74677b02.poster.avif?t=1788285912\" width=862 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/3b6b4e62fd2dcb2652703d4b74677b02.webm?t=1788285912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/3b6b4e62fd2dcb2652703d4b74677b02.mp4?t=1788285912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🦴 <strong>Hordes of enemies</strong> – Face relentless goblins, skeleton warriors, and terrifying undead monstrosities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/67aa7f64f850d30388856873a7d3af5a.poster.avif?t=1788285912\" width=862 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/67aa7f64f850d30388856873a7d3af5a.webm?t=1788285912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/67aa7f64f850d30388856873a7d3af5a.mp4?t=1788285912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>         </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕳 <strong>Seal the dark portals</strong> – Discover the source of the invasion and stop the spread of darkness before it’s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/b115546dfd36b68530ffe9fa9499d3fb.poster.avif?t=1788285912\" width=862 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/b115546dfd36b68530ffe9fa9499d3fb.webm?t=1788285912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/b115546dfd36b68530ffe9fa9499d3fb.mp4?t=1788285912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is more than just a battle for survival—it’s a fight for the fate of the world. <strong>Will you dare to face the abyss?</strong> </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your camp lies in ruins, and dark portals have begun tearing through the world — unleashing skeletal hordes, goblin raiders, and ancient undead into the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one knows where they came from. No one knows how to stop them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, you must gather resources, build your shelter, forge uneasy alliances, and descend into cursed dungeons to uncover the truth behind the portals — and find a way to destroy them before the corruption consumes everything.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏚 <strong>Build and expand your shelter</strong> – Gather resources, fortify your base, and prepare for the dangers ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >            <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/8ece0df47caa07a74cbdc998f8d90f73.poster.avif?t=1788285912\" width=862 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/8ece0df47caa07a74cbdc998f8d90f73.webm?t=1788285912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/342002